<title>LEBANON: Quake aftershock hits Lebanon.</title>
<headline>Quake aftershock hits Lebanon.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>A second earth tremor hit Lebanon on Wednesday, nine hours after an earthquake that caused cracks in buildings and measured 5.5 on the Richter scale.</p>
<p>The 15-second tremor shook Beirut buildings at 3.22 pm (1322 GMT). There was no immediate indication of damage or casualties.</p>
